#: settingstab.cpp:180
msgid "Advanced Mode"
msgstr "Verwiedert Bedrief"

#: settingstab.cpp:186
msgid "Simple Mode"
msgstr "Eenfach Bedrief"

#: simplesettings.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<p><b>Slow<br/>(low-res / slightly blurred images)</b></p><p>In this mode "
"the automatic detection and correction of the red eyes is the most reliable. "
"The drawback of the higher detection rate is a much slower computation.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Langsam<br/>(Siet Oplösen / en beten verwischt Biller)</b></p><p> In "
"disse Bedriefoort funkscheneert dat automaatsche Finnen un Richten vun root "
"Ogen op't Best. Man allens hett sien Pries: Dat Utreken bruukt so sien Tiet."
"</p>"

#: simplesettings.cpp:91
msgid ""
"<p><b>Standard</b></p><p>This mode is adequate for most image resolutions. "
"Always try this mode first.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Standard</b></p><p>Disse Bedriefoort passt to de mehrsten Bildoplösen. "
"Probeer ehr jümmers toeerst ut.</p>"

#: simplesettings.cpp:95
msgid ""
"<p><b>Fast<br/>(high-res images)</b></p><p>In this mode the automatic "
"detection will be faster, but more false positives may occur. Use this mode "
"only for very high-resolution and sharp images.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Gau<br/>(hoge Oplösen)</b></p><p>In disse Bedriefoort funkscheneert "
"dat Finnen gauer, man dat gifft ok mehr leeg Drepers. Bruuk de Bedriefoort "
"bloots bi scharp Biller mit redig hooch Oplösen.</p>"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:67
msgid "Storage Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för't Sekern"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<p>These settings control the storage of the corrected images. There are "
"three modes to choose from:</p><p><ul><li><b>Subfolder:</b> The corrected "
"images will be saved in a subfolder under the current album path.</"
"li><li><b>Suffix:</b> A custom suffix will be added to the corrected image.</"
"li><li><b>Overwrite:</b> All original images will be replaced.</li></ul></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse Instellen stüert dat Sekern vun de richt Biller. Dat gifft dree "
"Metoden:</p><p><ul><li><b>Ünnerorner:</b> De richt Biller warrt binnen en "
"Ünnerorner vun den aktuellen Orner sekert.</li><li><b>Verwiedern:</b> En "
"egen Verwiedern warrt dat richt Bild toföögt.</li><li><b>Överschrieven:</b> "
"Do Orginaalbiller warrt överschreven.</li></ul></p>"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:85
msgid "Enter the name of the subfolder here."
msgstr "Hier bitte den Naam vun den Ünnerorner ingeven"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:89
msgid "Save files in a subfolder"
msgstr "Dateien binnen en Ünnerorner sekern"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:90
msgid ""
"If checked, the corrected files will be saved in a subfolder under the "
"current image album path."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt de afarbeidt Dateien binnen en Ünnerorner vun't "
"aktuelle Bildalbum sekert."

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:94
msgid "Add suffix to filename"
msgstr "Suffix na Dateinaam tofögen"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:95
msgid "If checked, a custom suffix will be added to the corrected file."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt richt Dateien dat angeven Suffix anföögt."

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:98
msgid "Overwrite original files"
msgstr "Orginaaldateien överschrieven"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:99
msgid "If checked, all original images will be replaced."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt all Orginaaldateien utwesselt."

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:103
msgid "Enter the name of the suffix here..."
msgstr "Hier bitte den Naam för't Suffix ingeven..."

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:107
msgid ""
"<p><i>Note: At the moment this plugin will not keep any metadata (EXIF, "
"IPTC).<br/>DON'T USE OVERWRITE MODE, YOU WILL LOSE ALL INFORMATION!</i></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><i>Beacht bitte: Opstunns wohrt dit Moduul Metadaten (Exif, IPTC) nich)."
"<br/>Bruuk den Överschriev-Bedrief nich, Di kaamt all Informatschonen weg!</"
"i></p>"

#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:60
msgid "Unprocessed Images Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för nich afarbeidt Biller"

#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:62
msgid ""
"<p>These settings control the handling of unprocessed images when running in "
"testmode. To speed up the final correction, unprocessed images can be "
"removed from the list, so that they don't get analyzed again. There are "
"three modes to choose from:</p><p><ul><li><b>Ask the user:</b> A popup "
"window will appear to ask for further actions.</li><li><b>Keep:</b> All "
"unprocessed images will be kept in the list.</li><li><b>Remove:</b> All "
"unprocessed images are removed after testrun.</li></ul></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse Instellen stüert, wat min nich afarbeidt Biller in den Testbedrief "
"maakt warrt. Du kannst de Biller, de sik nich afarbeiden laat, vun de List "
"wegmaken. De Biller bruukt denn nich nochmaal ankeken warrn un de hele "
"Akschoon geiht gauer. Dat gifft dree Mööglichkeiten:</p><p><ul> "
"<li><b>Bruker fragen:</b> En Opdukfinster fraagt na, wat de Bruker will.</"
"li><li><b>Wohren:</b> De Biller blievt op de List.</li><li><b>Wegmaken:</b> "
"All Biller, de sik nich afarbeiden laat, warrt na den Testloop vun de List "
"wegmaakt.</li></ul></p>"

#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:80
msgid "Ask the user"
msgstr "Bruker fragen"

#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:81
msgid ""
"If checked, the user will be asked to keep or remove unprocessed images."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt de Bruker fraagt, wat he nich afarbeidt Biller wohren "
"oder wegmaken will."

#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:85
msgid "Keep"
msgstr "Wohren"

#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:86
msgid "If checked, unprocessed images will be kept after test-run."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt nich afarbeidt Biller na den Testloop wohrt."

#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:89
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Wegmaken"

#: unprocessedsettingsbox.cpp:90
msgid ""
"If checked, unprocessed images will be removed from the images list after "
"test-run."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt nich afarbeidt Biller na den Testloop vun de Billerlist "
"wegmaakt."

